      "card_ids": ["C31", "C54", "C64", "C70", "C07", "C10"],
      "claim": "Verapamil, the closest structural analog with dimethoxyphenyl and tertiary amine features, has human absolute oral bioavailability generally 22-38%, supporting F >= 20%."
    },
    {
      "card_ids": ["C01", "C17", "C71"],
      "claim": "Some verapamil studies report borderline values near 18-20%, but the majority of verapamil data are at or above 20%, so these do not affirmatively establish low bioavailability."
